SUMMARY:Lobo | Ava Trepeck | Esmé
LOCATION:Bowery Palace\, East Village
DESCRIPTION:On November 19\, LOBO headlines Bowery Palace for a night of mu
 
sic that aches and moves in equal measure. LOBO brings her sad anthems\, so
 
ngs made for dancing through heartbreak with your head out the car window. 
 
She's joined by Ava Trepeck\, a dream-indie storyteller whose raw\, etherea
 
l songs turn personal experience into vivid\, cinematic worlds. Opening the
 
 night is Esmé\, a Brooklyn singer\, songwriter\, and producer whose art p
 
op blends her jazz background\, Southern roots\, and alternative edge. Thre
 
e artists\, one through-line: big feelings\, beautifully sung. Tickets & in
 
fo: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/lobo-ava-trepeck-bowery-palace-tickets/
 
14364564
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/lobo-ava-trepeck-bowery-palace-tickets/
 
14364564
END:VEVENT
